0, "y": 600, "width": 1000, "height": 18.75, "text": "Only THIS first miss pays the 230ms \u2014 every other user hitting this edge afterward gets row 1.", "originalText": "Only THIS first miss pays the 230ms \u2014 every other user hitting this edge afterward gets row 1.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1030, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "ft1030", "x": 40, "y": 700, "width": 550.8, "height": 21.25, "text": "CACHE KEY \u2014 what the CDN treats as \"the same response\"", "originalText": "CACHE KEY \u2014 what the CDN treats as \"the same response\"", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1031, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "r1031", "x": 40, "y": 730, "width": 1760, "height": 130, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1032, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "ft1032", "x": 60, "y": 750, "width": 1700, "height": 20.0, "text": "Vary by:  Accept-Encoding (gzip vs br)  +  locale header  (correct: same hit rate, still per-language)", "originalText": "Vary by:  Accept-Encoding (gzip vs br)  +  locale header  (correct: same hit rate, still per-language)", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1033, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "ft1033", "x": 60, "y": 780, "width": 1700, "height": 20.0, "text": "Do NOT vary by:  session cookie  \u2014  if you do, every logged-in user gets their own cache entry and your hit rate collapses toward zero.", "originalText": "Do NOT vary by:  session cookie  \u2014  if you do, every logged-in user gets their own cache entry and your hit rate collapses toward zero.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1034, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "ft1034", "x": 60, "y": 810, "width": 1700, "height": 20.0, "text": "Get the vary-by list too NARROW instead (ignore locale) and you leak the wrong language to some users \u2014 same bug, opposite direction.", "originalText": "Get the vary-by list too NARROW instead (ignore locale) and you leak the wrong language to some users \u2014 same bug, opposite direction.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#f87171", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1034, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1035, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "bound